    <string name="pairing_stale_bond_guidance">Pairing rejected - the watch may still remember an old pairing. Automatic attempts are limited to two.\n\nOn the watch: Settings > Connections > Bluetooth > forget \"%1$s\".\n\nOn this device: remove \"%2$s\" (%3$s) from the Bluetooth list if present, including any old entry for that watch. Then tap Retry. If the watch address has changed, scan and select it again.</string>
